         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_5df197e9-ac98-ae9b-e063-6294a90ae662">
               <id root="5df197e9-ac97-ae9b-e063-6294a90ae662"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>Directions</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>·Wash and thoroughly dry the affected area.
  <br/>
·Shake well. Spray a thin layer twice daily
  <br/>
·Use daily for 4 weeks. If the condition persists, consult a doctor.
  <br/>
·For prevention, apply once or twice daily as directed.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261016"/>
            </section>
